nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T12:31:10Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T12:31:10Z","body":"Rebased","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4477679633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4487786138","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111849#issuecomment-4487786138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111849","id":4487786138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC34umg","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T12:37:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T12:37:42Z","body":"I think this is useful functionality. I'm particularly fond of the per-channel view.\r\n\r\nI tested the PR, and I have some UX comments:\r\n\r\nIt's a bit hard to understand whether some channels are active or not. I suggest using the same scheme as the 3d view: \r\n<img width=\"154\" height=\"103\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd6241eb-0d85-451f-8a43-6e306f18b28e\" />\r\n\r\nI would also suggest 2 more buttons for the channel: RGB, RGBA. RGBA is selected by default. RGB shows RGB without A\r\nClicking RGB is exclusive with RGBA and exclusive with per-component, while components stay non-exclusive with one another.\r\n\r\nWould it be possible to use the whole space to pan and zoom? it feels very wasteful to have all that lateral space unused.\r\n\r\nI would also label the MIP button. I would not completely disable it when there's no mipmap, i would just leave it there with disabled buttons. Alternatively, the up button is active but clicking it shows an error message that asks the user to enable mip if they want more mip.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4487786138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488890203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111849#issuecomment-4488890203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111849","id":4488890203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABC48HWw","user":{"login":"Arnklit","id":4955051,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NTUwNTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4955051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit","html_url":"https://github.com/Arnklit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arnklit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-19T14:41:42Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T14:41:42Z","body":"Thanks for the feedback @AThousandShips and @Calinou . I'll submit fixes for those issues soon. @KoBeWi I did not realise there was a helper class for exactly that, makes sense. I'll have a go at moving over to that.\r\n\r\n@QbieShay I didn't add the channel selectors and mipmap selectors, they are already in master, I just had to adjust them a bit to accomodate the UI. And I had to make sure they worked in the popped out preview.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4488890203/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4509244548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111849#issuecomment-4509244548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111849","id":4509244548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDMWchA","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/follo